@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 210
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide circle
hide empty members
package "电子原单与收退结果核对" as E {
' @reference patient_funds
class "患者资金" as funds_e <<entity>>
' @reference bill
class "应收账目" as bill_e <<entity>>
' @reference patient_payment
class "患者付款" as payment_e <<entity>>
' @reference patient_refund
class "退款办理" as refund_e <<entity>>
class "电子支付单" as payment_order <<entity>> {
 所属门店
 唯一原单号、渠道、金额
 平台交易号、核实时间
 支付状态
 --
 +核对原单金额及渠道()
 +记录受理或待核实()
 +确认渠道结果(原单与交易号)
}
class "收退款核对" as payment_reconciliation <<entity>> {
 所属门店
 营业日期、原单金额
 渠道实际额、差异与状态
 核对人、处理依据
 --
 +核对收款或退款原单()
 +记录核对结果(正式依据)
 +记录差异处理(原办理结果)
}
funds_e "1" -- "0..*" payment_order
bill_e "0..1" -- "0..*" payment_order
payment_order "0..1" -- "0..1" payment_e
payment_order "0..1" -- "0..*" payment_reconciliation
payment_e "0..1" -- "0..*" payment_reconciliation
refund_e "0..1" -- "0..*" payment_reconciliation
funds_e -[hidden]right- bill_e
note bottom of payment_reconciliation
现金付款、电子支付单或退款办理恰选其一。
受理、截图或金额相似不代表到账成功；
差异处理引用原办理，不补造收款或退款。
end note
}
package "实际费用及账目核算" as B {
' @reference patient
class "患者" as patient_b <<entity>>
' @reference patient_funds
class "患者资金" as funds_b <<entity>>
' @reference treatment_execution
class "诊疗执行" as execution_b <<entity>>
' @reference dispense_record
class "实际发药" as dispense_b <<entity>>
' @reference service_price
class "价目" as price_b <<entity>>
' @reference insurance_case
class "医保就诊办理" as insurance_case_b <<entity>>
' @reference insurance_settlement
class "医保结算" as insurance_settlement_b <<entity>>
class "应收账目" as bill <<entity>> {
 所属门店
 形成时间、计费期间
 /G总应收、/I正式医保承担
 /P患者应付、/S有效抵付
 /待付、/不能最终结算原因
 --
 +汇总已核价应收(生效调整)
 +核对正式医保分摊()
 +计算当前待付(有效抵付)
}
class "应收项目" as bill_item <<entity>> {
 实际数量、单价快照
 核价状态、计费时点
 核价人及依据
 --
 +核对唯一实际来源()
 +确认计价(适用价目与依据)
 +计算项目金额()
 +建立实际来源(计价状态)
}
patient_b "1" -- "0..*" bill
funds_b "1" -- "0..*" bill
bill "1" *-- "0..*" bill_item
execution_b "0..1" -- "1" bill_item
dispense_b "0..1" -- "1" bill_item
price_b "0..1" -- "0..*" bill_item
bill "0..1" -- "0..*" insurance_case_b
insurance_case_b "1" -- "0..*" insurance_settlement_b
patient_b -[hidden]right- funds_b
execution_b -[hidden]right- dispense_b
dispense_b -[hidden]right- price_b
note bottom of bill_item
应收来源：诊疗执行或实际发药恰选其一。
G＝已核价金额＋生效调整；P＝G－I。
I仅取有效正式医保基金及个账承担，自费为0。
待付＝max(P－S,0)；缺价或医保未定不报最终数。
释放计入S净额，实际退款不再次扣减S。
end note
}
@enduml
